ep. Cisneros, Gilbert Ray [D-CA-31]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-05-19","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"B001296","fullName":"Rep. Boyle, Brendan F. [D-PA-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-06-08","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"},{"bioguideId":"T000487","fullName":"Rep. Tokuda, Jill N. [D-HI-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-06-11","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"HI"},{"bioguideId":"P000608","fullName":"Rep. Peters, Scott H. [D-CA-50]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-08-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"D000631","fullName":"Rep. Dean, Madeleine [D-PA-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-08-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"},{"bioguideId":"M001196","fullName":"Rep. Moulton, Seth [D-MA-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-08-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MA"},{"bioguideId":"R000606","fullName":"Rep. Raskin, Jamie [D-MD-8]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-09-08","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MD"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T16:30:33+00:00","id":"hres925-119","introducedDate":"2025-12-03","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-12-03","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Foreign Affairs."},"laws":[],"number":"925","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"International Affairs","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"S001145","district":9,"fullName":"Rep. Schakowsky, Janice D. [D-IL-9]","party":"D","state":"IL"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-12-03","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p>This resolution condemns Iran's state-sponsored persecution of the Baha'i religious minority and Iran's continued violation of international human rights treaties. The resolution calls on Iran to (1) immediately release Baha'is and others imprisoned or detained solely on account of religion, (2) end its state-sponsored campaign of hate propaganda against the Baha'is, and (3) reverse certain policies that discriminate against Baha'is and other religious minorities. The resolution also urges the President and the Department of State to impose sanctions on Iranian officials and others who are responsible for serious human rights abuses, including abuses against Iran's Baha'i community.</p>","updateDate":"2026-09-15T14:42:54Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Condemning the Government of Iran's state-sponsored persecution of the Baha'i minority in Iran and the continued violation of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights and the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights.","type":"hres","updateDate":"2026-09-15T14:42:59Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-15T14:42:59Z"}
